From 15b61ed84a87de06eab9e33bb919fbeb759cf83e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 22:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Port PadelGo codebase to Ace Town, strip PadelGo/InstaPadel
 branding

Copies the Next.js App Router + Supabase codebase from PadelGo, then:
- Replaces all PadelGo/InstaPadel display text with Ace Town
- Renames instapadel/padelgo-prefixed localStorage keys
- Renames the npm package to ace-town
- Introduces NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL / RESEND_FROM_EMAIL env-driven config
  instead of hardcoded instapadel.tech domain and no-reply address
  (sitemap, robots, Open Graph tags, email templates)
- Converts static robots.txt to a dynamic app/robots.js using that config
- Removes PadelGo's stale Google Search Console verification file
- Adds .env.example for the Ace Town Supabase project env vars

Still pending: PadelGo's real WhatsApp/phone number and address are
still hardcoded in the footer and floating WhatsApp button, waiting on
the real Ace Town contact details before those are swapped in.
